### ZKTeco Attendance API - sample requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client format)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN_RESPONSE

### Login (default seeded operator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Current profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Institutes (proxied + cached from api.shebashikkha.com)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/institutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Classes for an institute
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/institutes/1/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List devices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devices?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a device
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "F18-0001",
  "name": "Main Gate F18",
  "instituteId": 1,
  "ipAddress": "192.168.1.115",
  "port": 4370,
  "location": "Main Gate"
}

### List device users (biometric-enrolled people)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?instituteId=1&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a device user (queues a DATA UPDATE USERINFO command to the device)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instituteId": 1,
  "classId": 2,
  "className": "One",
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "enrollNo": "1001",
  "cardNo": "",
  "devicePrivilege": "COMMON",
  "deviceId": 1
}

### Bulk delete device users
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/bulk-delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": [1, 2, 3]
}

### List roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List permissions (for building the role checkbox form)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "INSTITUTE_MANAGER",
  "description": "Manage devices and users for one institute",
  "permissionIds": [1, 2, 6, 7]
}

### Attendance search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance?instituteId=1&fromDate=2026-07-01&toDate=2026-07-27&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Attendance CSV export
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/export?instituteId=1&fromDate=2026-07-01&toDate=2026-07-27
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Command monitor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/commands?status=PENDING&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================
### ZKTeco F18 device protocol (ADMS/iClock) - called BY the device,
### shown here only for reference/manual testing with curl/Postman.
### No Authorization header - devices authenticate via SN only.
### ============================================================

### Device handshake
GET {{baseUrl}}/iclock/cdata?SN=F18-0001&options=all

### Device pushes attendance logs
POST {{baseUrl}}/iclock/cdata?SN=F18-0001&table=ATTLOG
Content-Type: text/plain

1001	2026-07-27 08:15:00	0	1	0	0	0	0	0

### Device polls for pending commands
GET {{baseUrl}}/iclock/getrequest?SN=F18-0001

### Device reports a command result
POST {{baseUrl}}/iclock/device-command-result?SN=F18-0001&ID=1&Return=0&CMD=DATA+UPDATE+USERINFO
